WEBVTT

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.291
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:00:04.416 --> 00:00:06.958
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:09.625
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:14.000
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:30.875
<c.Caption-C6_1>When you feel down

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:33.750
<c.Caption-C7_1>And you are at your wit's end

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:37.500
<c.Caption-C8_1>Ask the Popotan for advice

00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:41.666
<c.Caption-C9_1>Yes, if you can be honest

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:44.375
<c.Caption-C10_1>And open up your heart

00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:48.625
<c.Caption-C11_1>The Popotan will show the way

00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:51.500
<c.Caption-C12_1>Will he come or not?

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.208
<c.Caption-C13_1>Does he love me or not?

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:56.833
<c.Caption-C14_1>Is this love true or false?

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:01.875
<c.Caption-C15_1>They have all the answers

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.291
<c.Caption-C16_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:08.083
<c.Caption-C17_1>I can't take it! Po po po!

00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:13.583
<c.Caption-C18_1>I know, but I just can't stop!

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:16.125
<c.Caption-C19_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:18.541
<c.Caption-C20_1>It's impossible! Po Po Po!

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:24.333
<c.Caption-C21_1>Even if it's just a dream, never give up!

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:26.541
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:41.583
<c.Caption-C23_1>Souvenirs

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>Wh-What was that?!

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:46.583
<c.Caption-C24_1>Hot Springs

00:01:46.916 --> 00:01:48.291
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>Is that true?!

00:01:48.291 --> 00:01:49.333
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>Yes.

00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:51.000
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>But I didn't see it very clearly.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.291
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>Right.

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:54.750
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Then we just have to look around here.

00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:56.958
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>Thank goodness.

00:01:57.291 --> 00:02:01.416
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>When we ended up at this hot springs

00:01:57.292 --> 00:02:01.416
<c.Subtitle-C9_2>resort I didn't know what it meant.

00:02:02.208 --> 00:02:04.791
<c.Caption-C25_1>Spring Bloom Hot Springs

00:02:02.209 --> 00:02:04.791
<c.Caption-C25_2>Against Amusement Park

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.791
<c.Caption-C25_3>Development!

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.500
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>So, what did it feel like?

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.875
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>What was it like?

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:14.375
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Well, like I said, I didn't see it very clearly.

00:02:14.375 --> 00:02:15.500
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>But...

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.625
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>...this one will show us the way.

00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:20.166
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>As long as we do what she says.

00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:21.291
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>Huh?

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:26.875
<c.Caption-C26_1>Amusement Park

00:02:22.376 --> 00:02:26.875
<c.Caption-C26_2>Development Site

00:02:22.377 --> 00:02:24.458
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>Well, I'll see you all later.

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:26.416
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Oh, no, Mea.

00:02:26.416 --> 00:02:27.208
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>Yes?

00:02:27.208 --> 00:02:30.666
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>You must come along as well.

00:02:27.209 --> 00:02:30.666
<c.Subtitle-C20_2>That's what she's saying.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.708
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>But the job of a housekeeper

00:02:31.501 --> 00:02:35.708
<c.Subtitle-C21_2>is to watch the house.

00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:39.208
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>She says she won't tell us

00:02:35.709 --> 00:02:39.208
<c.Subtitle-C22_2>unless we do as she says.

00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>Is that right?

00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:42.208
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>I understand.

00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:44.750
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>Damn.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.958
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>I was hoping to take a nap.

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:49.208
<c.Caption-C27_1>Spring Bloom

00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:49.208
<c.Caption-C27_2>Sweets

00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:51.166
<c.Caption-C28_1>Hot Springs Inn

00:02:49.209 --> 00:02:51.166
<c.Caption-C28_2>Hagehage

00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:53.125
<c.Caption-C29_1>Spring Bloom

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:53.125
<c.Caption-C29_2>Sweets

00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:57.166
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>Why would a popotan want to go

00:02:53.626 --> 00:02:57.166
<c.Subtitle-C27_2>on a walk through town?

00:02:57.166 --> 00:02:58.583
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>Why not?

00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:00.083
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>There's no harm.

00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:03.083
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Well, I know that, but...

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:07.583
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>It's just that the Spring Festival has started.

00:03:08.041 --> 00:03:10.958
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>There are popotan decorations

00:03:08.042 --> 00:03:10.958
<c.Subtitle-C32_2>all over the place.

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Maybe it would be better if we

00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:15.708
<c.Subtitle-C33_2>just asked other popotan as well.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.791
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>I already asked, but they don't know.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.583
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>Oh, you already asked?

00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:23.416
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>Yes, all the flowers.

00:03:23.416 --> 00:03:24.541
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>All? You serious?

00:03:24.541 --> 00:03:25.208
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Yes.

00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:30.916
<c.Caption-C30_1>Jelly Cakes

00:03:25.208 --> 00:03:27.958
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Come and get them!

00:03:25.209 --> 00:03:27.958
<c.Subtitle-C39_2>Spring bloom jelly cakes!

00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:29.166
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>They're very good!

00:03:29.166 --> 00:03:30.458
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>Yeah!

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:31.541
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>There you go.

00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:34.916
<c.Caption-C31_1>Spring Bloom

00:03:32.667 --> 00:03:34.916
<c.Caption-C31_2>Coffee

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.500
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>Come on, Mii.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.666
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>Spring bloom coffee-flavored sweets...

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:41.666
<c.Caption-C32_1>Spring Bloom Coffee

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>...and spring bloom jelly.

00:03:36.667 --> 00:03:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C45_2>Would you like to try?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.666
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>It's an excellent source of nutrition.

00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:45.250
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Excuse me but coffee and

00:03:42.084 --> 00:03:45.250
<c.Subtitle-C47_2>jelly are junk foods...

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:45.583
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>...and have no nutritional value.

00:03:45.583 --> 00:03:47.208
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>What're you doing, Mea?

00:03:45.584 --> 00:03:47.208
<c.Subtitle-C49_2>...and have no nutritional value.

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:51.000
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>So, how about entering

00:03:47.209 --> 00:03:51.000
<c.Subtitle-C50_2>the Miss Spring Bloom Pageant?

00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:53.333
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>Me?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:54.958
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>You too, Ai?

00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>What about you?

00:03:55.626 --> 00:03:58.083
<c.Subtitle-C53_2>The Miss Spring Bloom Pageant?

00:03:58.125 --> 00:03:59.166
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Me?

00:03:59.166 --> 00:04:00.291
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>No, no, no!

00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:01.958
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>I really don't want to.

00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:03.625
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>Why not?

00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:07.250
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>I mean, she's suggesting it, too.

00:04:07.958 --> 00:04:09.333
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>You keep saying "she".

00:04:09.375 --> 00:04:13.083
<c.Caption-C33_1>Miss Spring Bloom Pageant

00:04:09.583 --> 00:04:13.708
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Boys and gentlemen, uncles and grandpas!

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:16.625
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>Let's hear it for the

00:04:13.709 --> 00:04:16.625
<c.Subtitle-C61_2>Miss Spring Bloom Pageant!

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:22.708
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>And now, let's bring on

00:04:19.542 --> 00:04:22.708
<c.Subtitle-C62_2>the next contestants.

00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:25.958
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>Entry number 10 is Ai!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.291
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>And entry number 11 is Mai!

00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:29.833
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>They're sisters!

00:04:33.791 --> 00:04:36.416
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>And next we've got entry number 12...

00:04:36.416 --> 00:04:38.041
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>...the maid, Mea!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.416
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>And next!

00:04:45.416 --> 00:04:48.416
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>We've got entry number 13! Mii!

00:04:50.625 --> 00:04:53.916
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>Picohan Magical! Parallel Magical!

00:04:57.041 --> 00:04:59.625
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>What's this creepy feeling

00:04:57.042 --> 00:04:59.625
<c.Subtitle-C71_2>I get from these guys?

00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:06.166
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>The winner is number 13, Mii!

00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:07.125
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Yay!

00:05:08.291 --> 00:05:09.333
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>What the...?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.250
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Winner!

00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:12.958
<c.Caption-C34_1>Miss

00:05:11.334 --> 00:05:12.958
<c.Caption-C34_2>Spring

00:05:11.335 --> 00:05:12.958
<c.Caption-C34_3>Bloom

00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>I win! I win! I'm Miss Spring Bloom!

00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:26.208
<c.Caption-C35_1>Miss Spring Bloom

00:05:24.209 --> 00:05:26.208
<c.Caption-C35_2>Third Place

00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:26.541
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>Damn. Third place.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.666
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>Give me a break.

00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>What was that? Talk about a rigged contest!

00:05:36.583 --> 00:05:39.458
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>There are those with no puffy-puffy...

00:05:39.458 --> 00:05:43.708
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>...and those with a puffy-puffy.

00:05:39.459 --> 00:05:43.708
<c.Subtitle-C81_2>That's what made the difference.

00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:45.833
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>I didn't hear anything about that!

00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:48.208
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>W-What?

00:05:48.166 --> 00:05:49.166
<c.Caption-C36_1>Miss Spring Bloom

00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:49.166
<c.Caption-C36_2>Third Place

00:05:51.875 --> 00:05:53.125
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>I don't want it!

00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:54.708
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>Third place, my ass!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.333
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>Since we're at a famous

00:05:55.001 --> 00:05:58.333
<c.Subtitle-C86_2>hot springs resort...

00:05:58.333 --> 00:06:00.208
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>...how about we go in for a dip?

00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:02.916
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>What do you mean?

00:06:03.791 --> 00:06:05.541
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>That's what she's saying.

00:06:07.583 --> 00:06:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>It's so warm!

00:06:07.584 --> 00:06:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C90_2>But why would a popotan want us

00:06:07.585 --> 00:06:09.291
<c.Subtitle-C90_3>to go in the hot springs?

00:06:09.291 --> 00:06:11.875
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>But why would a popotan want us

00:06:09.292 --> 00:06:11.875
<c.Subtitle-C91_2>to go in the hot springs?

00:06:12.041 --> 00:06:14.291
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>I mean, there's no one else here.

00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:16.208
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>Well, that may be so, but...

00:06:16.416 --> 00:06:18.166
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>Wow! What a huge bath!

00:06:18.166 --> 00:06:20.083
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>Don't swim! Just settle down!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>The spring waters contain

00:06:23.501 --> 00:06:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C96_2>nitrogen and sodium.

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.375
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>It's good for rheumatism, nervous tension...

00:06:29.375 --> 00:06:31.833
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>I didn't ask! And you can't tell by taste!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.166
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>Oh, my. Is that so?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.375
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>Ai, stop chatting away like that.

00:06:34.501 --> 00:06:37.375
<c.Subtitle-C100_2>I see. I see.

00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:39.708
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>Let's just get on with it.

00:06:37.376 --> 00:06:39.708
<c.Subtitle-C101_2>I see. Is that so?

00:06:39.791 --> 00:06:41.583
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>Shall we go to the next one?

00:06:41.583 --> 00:06:42.833
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>Next?

00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:44.291
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>That's what she's saying.

00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:47.750
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>So.

00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:50.541
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Oh, I've never heard that before.

00:06:50.583 --> 00:06:52.291
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>Please, Ai.

00:06:52.541 --> 00:06:56.000
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>This spring water contains calcium and

00:06:52.542 --> 00:06:56.000
<c.Subtitle-C108_2>sodium carbonate. It's good for...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.625
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>I don't care!

00:06:57.625 --> 00:06:59.791
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>Yoo-hoo!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>Stop that.

00:07:01.875 --> 00:07:03.291
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>Onto the next one.

00:07:04.541 --> 00:07:05.791
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Oh, is that so?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.541
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>That must've been tough.

00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:11.250
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>Oh, my. You speak so well.

00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:19.208
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>Oh, after soaking all day,

00:07:15.334 --> 00:07:19.208
<c.Subtitle-C116_2>I'm turning into a prune.

00:07:19.208 --> 00:07:23.333
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>It's not safe to spend

00:07:19.209 --> 00:07:23.333
<c.Subtitle-C117_2>too much time in a hot spring.

00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:25.833
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>It's a bit late for that!

00:07:23.334 --> 00:07:25.833
<c.Subtitle-C118_2>And who are you talking to?

00:07:25.958 --> 00:07:27.166
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>Now, now.

00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:29.541
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>Just get changed into this.

00:07:30.333 --> 00:07:31.333
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>Why?

00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:33.583
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>Well, this is a hot spring.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>There's nothing like playing

00:07:38.334 --> 00:07:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C123_2>ping pong in Yukata.

00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:42.416
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>You promised, after all.

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:44.625
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>Is that what it's saying?

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:46.083
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>Yes.

00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:47.000
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Uh, right.

00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:48.833
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>There!

00:07:48.916 --> 00:07:49.666
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>There!

00:08:04.583 --> 00:08:05.500
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>Gotcha!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:10.416
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>My ultimate Popotan Smash!

00:08:15.041 --> 00:08:16.750
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>The winner is Mai!

00:08:20.083 --> 00:08:21.541
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>I lost.

00:08:21.583 --> 00:08:22.583
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>All right.

00:08:23.041 --> 00:08:25.291
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>There! You happy now?

00:08:25.291 --> 00:08:27.000
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>Now, let's carry on.

00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:32.375
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Next, she wants Mai and Mea

00:08:27.376 --> 00:08:32.375
<c.Subtitle-C137_2>to play against each other.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:37.500
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>"Hey! Are you going to do it

00:08:33.251 --> 00:08:37.500
<c.Subtitle-C138_2>or not?!", she asks.

00:08:39.375 --> 00:08:42.041
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>I've had enough!

00:08:39.376 --> 00:08:42.041
<c.Subtitle-C139_2>We're not doing this for fun!

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:45.208
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>Tell us now or I'll stick my hand

00:08:42.084 --> 00:08:45.208
<c.Subtitle-C140_2>through your ears!

00:08:45.208 --> 00:08:47.458
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>Or we'll throw you away

00:08:45.209 --> 00:08:47.458
<c.Subtitle-C141_2>and find another popotan!

00:08:47.458 --> 00:08:49.583
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>Got that! Is that what you want?!

00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:50.791
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>Take it easy, Mai.

00:08:50.791 --> 00:08:51.750
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>That's right.

00:08:53.583 --> 00:08:55.541
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>I'm all ready.

00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:56.625
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>Yay!

